    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120440/extras/99f1ba5026e44027a56cf732fd3b444d.poster.avif?t=1737588846\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120440/extras/99f1ba5026e44027a56cf732fd3b444d.webm?t=1737588846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120440/extras/99f1ba5026e44027a56cf732fd3b444d.mp4?t=1737588846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Dash and blast your way through rhythmically entranced enemies.<br>Can you keep up with the beat?</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Shoot to the beat.<br></li><li> Get to the end of the level before the music runs out.<br></li><li> Enemies move and attack in sync with the music.<br></li><li> Randomized level generation. Levels are different every time.<br></li><li> Play with your own mp3s for a different experience.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120440/extras/217f82cff4d8ff5d63141c1fb4fa62bc.poster.avif?t=1737588846\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120440/extras/217f82cff4d8ff5d63141c1fb4fa62bc.webm?t=1737588846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120440/extras/217f82cff4d8ff5d63141c1fb4fa62bc.mp4?t=1737588846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
